#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "<div class=\"credits-box\" style=\"margin-top:0;\"><h2>Netzac Chat</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">To configure this button to open your chat service, open <b>Edit &rsaquo; Preferences &rsaquo; Quick Links</b> and set the <b>Chat URL</b>.</p></div>"
msgstr "<div class=\"credits-box\" style=\"margin-top:0;\"><h2>Netzac 聊天</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">要配置此按钮以打开您的聊天服务，请打开<b>编辑 &rsaquo; 偏好设置 &rsaquo; 快捷链接</b>并设置<b>聊天 URL</b>。</p></div>"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "<div class=\"credits-box\" style=\"margin-top:0;\"><h2>Netzac Git</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">To configure this button to open your Git forge (for example GitHub, GitLab or Gitea), open <b>Edit &rsaquo; Preferences &rsaquo; Quick Links</b> and set the <b>Git URL</b>.</p></div>"
msgstr "<div class=\"credits-box\" style=\"margin-top:0;\"><h2>Netzac Git</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">要配置此按钮以打开您的 Git 托管平台（例如 GitHub、GitLab 或 Gitea），请打开<b>编辑 &rsaquo; 偏好设置 &rsaquo; 快捷链接</b>并设置<b>Git URL</b>。</p></div>"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "<div class=\"credits-box\" style=\"margin-top:0;\"><h2>Netzac Mail</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">To configure this button to open your mail link (for example Gmail or webmail), open <b>Edit &rsaquo; Preferences &rsaquo; Quick Links</b> and set the <b>Mail URL</b>.</p></div>"
msgstr "<div class=\"credits-box\" style=\"margin-top:0;\"><h2>Netzac 邮件</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">要配置此按钮以打开您的邮箱链接（例如 Gmail 或网页邮箱），请打开<b>编辑 &rsaquo; 偏好设置 &rsaquo; 快捷链接</b>并设置<b>邮件 URL</b>。</p></div>"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "<p>Unknown built-in Navigator location.</p>"
msgstr "<p>未知的内置 Navigator 地址。</p>"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "<p>Welcome aboard <b>Netzac Navigator 1.0</b> running on <b>ZacOS 9</b>.</p><p>Quick links to explore the classic &amp; text-friendly Web:</p><div class=\"cards\"><a class=\"card\" href=\"https://frogfind.com\"><strong>FrogFind!</strong><span>Classic search engine for retro browsers</span></a><a class=\"card\" href=\"https://wiby.me\"><strong>Wiby</strong><span>Search engine for classic web pages</span></a><a class=\"card\" href=\"http://68k.news\"><strong>68k.news</strong><span>Fast headlines formatted for classic Macs</span></a><a class=\"card\" href=\"https://theoldnet.com\"><strong>The Old Net</strong><span>Browse snapshots of the 1990s web</span></a></div><div class=\"credits-box\"><h2>Credits &amp; Community</h2><p>Netzac started as an initial idea by <b>Lucas Guimarães</b>. We hope to count on the full support of the <b>ZacOS 9</b> community for contributions, ideas, and pull requests at <a href=\"https://github.com/guimaraeslucas/netzac\">github.com/guimaraeslucas/netzac</a>.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">Special thanks to <b>Adam Lawson (@chromasystemprofessional)</b> for creating this incredible ZacOS 9 project.</p></div>"
msgstr "<p>欢迎使用运行在 <b>ZacOS 9</b> 上的 <b>Netzac Navigator 1.0</b>。</p><p>探索经典与纯文本友好网页的快捷链接：</p><div class=\"cards\"><a class=\"card\" href=\"https://frogfind.com\"><strong>FrogFind!</strong><span>面向复古浏览器的经典搜索引擎</span></a><a class=\"card\" href=\"https://wiby.me\"><strong>Wiby</strong><span>经典网页搜索引擎</span></a><a class=\"card\" href=\"http://68k.news\"><strong>68k.news</strong><span>专为经典 Mac 格式化的快速头条新闻</span></a><a class=\"card\" href=\"https://theoldnet.com\"><strong>The Old Net</strong><span>浏览 20 世纪 90 年代的网页快照</span></a></div><div class=\"credits-box\"><h2>致谢与社区</h2><p>Netzac 最初源自 <b>Lucas Guimarães</b> 的构想。我们期待 <b>ZacOS 9</b> 社区在 <a href=\"https://github.com/guimaraeslucas/netzac\">github.com/guimaraeslucas/netzac</a> 提供贡献、创意与 Pull Request。</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">特别感谢 <b>Adam Lawson (@chromasystemprofessional)</b> 打造了卓越的 ZacOS 9 项目。</p></div>"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "<ul class=\"shortcut-list\"><li><span><b>Collapse Toolbars</b></span><span>Click the ribbed grip on the left of any toolbar</span></li><li><span><b>Open Page</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+O</code></span></li><li><span><b>New / Close Tab</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+T</code> / <code>Ctrl+W</code></span></li><li><span><b>Find in Page / Find Again</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+F</code> or <code>F4</code> / <code>Ctrl+G</code></span></li><li><span><b>Zoom In / Out / Reset</b></span><span><code>Ctrl++</code> / <code>Ctrl+-</code> / <code>Ctrl+0</code></span></li><li><span><b>Add / Manage Bookmarks</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+D</code> / <code>Ctrl+B</code></span></li><li><span><b>Reload / Stop</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+R</code> or <code>F5</code> / <code>Esc</code></span></li><li><span><b>Full Screen</b></span><span><code>F11</code></span></li><li><span><b>Calm Mode</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+Shift+C</code></span></li><li><span><b>Page Source / Info</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+U</code> / <code>Ctrl+I</code></span></li></ul>"
msgstr "<ul class=\"shortcut-list\"><li><span><b>折叠工具栏</b></span><span>点击任意工具栏左侧的凹凸条纹手柄</span></li><li><span><b>打开页面</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+O</code></span></li><li><span><b>新建 / 关闭标签页</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+T</code> / <code>Ctrl+W</code></span></li><li><span><b>在页面中查找 / 再次查找</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+F</code> 或 <code>F4</code> / <code>Ctrl+G</code></span></li><li><span><b>放大 / 缩小 / 重置缩放</b></span><span><code>Ctrl++</code> / <code>Ctrl+-</code> / <code>Ctrl+0</code></span></li><li><span><b>添加 / 管理书签</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+D</code> / <code>Ctrl+B</code></span></li><li><span><b>重新加载 / 停止</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+R</code> 或 <code>F5</code> / <code>Esc</code></span></li><li><span><b>全屏</b></span><span><code>F11</code></span></li><li><span><b>宁静模式</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+Shift+C</code></span></li><li><span><b>页面源代码 / 页面信息</b></span><span><code>Ctrl+U</code> / <code>Ctrl+I</code></span></li></ul>"

